  "text": "Xavier University - Quick Links Toggle navigation Home About Xavier University University President Centennial Alumni Communications Office Contact Us Offices Office of the President Cluster Administration Cluster Mission & Ministry Cluster Social Development Cluster Higher Education Cluster Basic Education Cluster Finance University Registrar Testing & Admissions Testing Office Admissions Admissions Tracker Scholarships Enroll Now Professional Schools Undergraduate Schools & Colleges SHS - ALGCIT SHS Junior High Grade School Academics Office of the Vice President for Higher Education Professional Schools Office of Graduate Studies Undergraduate Schools and Colleges Basic Education Cluster Xavier Center For Lifelong Learning (X-CeLL) Research Kinaadman: University Research Office (KURO) XU Press Research Ethics Office (REO) Knowledge and Technology Transfer Office (KTTO) Journals Sustainability President's Memo Quick Links XU Integrated Help Desk Management System Xavier Ateneo Data Privacy Policy HRIS SLMIS Canvas XU Mail Quick Links Entrance Exam Result Access the result of your admission test. Online Application Eligible admission applicants must create an XU Online Application account. Libraries The Xavier University Libraries (XUL) is more than a cluster of libraries; it connects people with information by providing diverse resources and services to the academic community. Each library has an immense collection of books, journals, films, maps, databases, and more. XUL develops and maintains a broad array of information resources, including TLC Catalog Search, article and indexing databases, e-journal subscriptions, and specialized collections crossing subjects, formats, and genres. XUL also provides computing resources, including public computers, audio-visual rooms, and software services. SLMIS Access your Student Lifecycle Management and Information System (SLMIS) to check your schedule, room assignments and grades. eLearn eLearn is XU’s online classroom where students make use of the new media to pursue academic excellence and virtual connectivity. XUTV Launched in 2015, Xavier University Television (XUTV) is a production frontlined by the Development Communication Department.  Episodes focus on XU’s thematic goals on environment, peace, food security, governance and health, among others. Crusader Yearbook The Crusader Yearbook is the official annual compendium of Xavier University – Ateneo de Cagayan, capturing the gist of the students’ university experience in a creative and quality package. Weather Station XU Weather Station provides you with precise weather updates via the WeatherLink Network – Vantage Pro Plus Data. About Higher Education Cluster Professional Schools School of Medicine School of Law (SOE) School of Education Graduate School (SBM) School of Business & Management Graduate School College of Engineering Graduate Studies Undergraduate Schools and Colleges College of Agriculture College of Arts and Sciences College of Computer Studies College of Engineering College of Nursing School of Business and Management School of Education Basic Education Cluster Senior High School Senior High School (Academic Track) Senior High School TechVoc-ALGCIT Junior High School Grade School Preschool University Registrar University Academic Programs University Libraries International Cooperation and Networking University Dean's List Accreditation Higher Education School Calendar Admissions FAQ on College Admissions & Scholarship Undergraduate Program Offerings Lists of Accepted Applicants Incoming College Freshmen Online Admissions & Enrollment Process - Incoming First-Year External Online Admissions & Enrollment Process - Incoming First-Year Internal Online Admissions and Enrollment Process for Transferee and Second Undergraduate Degree Program Applicants Online Admissions and Enrollment Process for Returnee Applicants Online Admissions & Enrollment Process for Returnees 2503 Intersession International Student 